<!-- 4 INSIGHT 1 -->
<section class="slide">
  <h2>Step 2 · Insight ①: we live in a 0/1 world</h2>
  <p>Rule A is used <b>at most once at the start</b> to turn x into a 0/1 number. After that, look at what “−1” does to a 0/1 number. There are only two cases:</p>
  <div class="row">
    <div class="card">
      <h3>Case 1: ends in <span style="color:var(--odd)">1</span></h3>
